  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "扬州从隋炀帝以来，是诗人文士所称道的地方；称道的多了，称道得久了，一般人便也随声附和起来。",
      "output_sha256": "8a247b5c185eb6704c79105e296009214fd4199c5acf1f4869e452a96fa03c1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a247b5c185eb6704c79105e296009214fd4199c5acf1f4869e452a96fa03c1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "直到今天，若你提起扬州，许多人会点头表示：“好地方！",
      "output_sha256": "94e6c19affd95a5705d82fd2ff0796e8ac850279313ef1e4f1b555c70371f14c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.487463,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5b9be200e9be783dc935358b80115158133d400ce9ee206795b1799b86a289b7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "94e6c19affd95a5705d82fd2ff0796e8ac850279313ef1e4f1b555c70371f14c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好地方！”",
      "output_sha256": "cece4e382636a5c677a85d2614e3e99fda2807b1a137efd5bee2523e28955219",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "cece4e382636a5c677a85d2614e3e99fda2807b1a137efd5bee2523e28955219",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "特别是没去过扬州而念过些唐诗的人，在他心里，扬州真像蜃楼海市一般美丽；他若念过《扬州画舫录》一类书，那更了不得了。",
      "output_sha256": "14b1c7d8654a96f2a49d985f3b0f4193c4fd2f6a15d343332f029b1cd1b153dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "14b1c7d8654a96f2a49d985f3b0f4193c4fd2f6a15d343332f029b1cd1b153dc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但在一个久住扬州像我的人，他却没有那么多美丽的幻想，他的憎恶也许掩住了他的爱好；他也许离开了三四年并不去想它。",
      "output_sha256": "9480580f6ca7f4893718aef9d91f433aeb6a6b231761d9e5d0c52f87253f254b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "9480580f6ca7f4893718aef9d91f433aeb6a6b231761d9e5d0c52f87253f254b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若是想起，想的又是什么呢？",
      "output_sha256": "caf15b365e30b701d6afa7b218fb596d2f707fe2ecc99c0bf54a9fad2ce60941",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.520211,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "acd08f115d442e751dc8e3730477253b2e467a3e5936630747210588be291ee4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "caf15b365e30b701d6afa7b218fb596d2f707fe2ecc99c0bf54a9fad2ce60941",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "女人；不错，这似乎也有名，但怕不是现在的女人吧？",
      "output_sha256": "9ccbe6ea852db8eba09e928c262d8111b97aaf6d4b3d044bf4d0681ec79bfd72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ccbe6ea852db8eba09e928c262d8111b97aaf6d4b3d044bf4d0681ec79bfd72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他也只会想着扬州的夏日，虽然与女人仍然不无关系的。",
      "output_sha256": "07f010beb9f79b943ff3575f03177d9105b993634d9497b9938e96c3ed65216e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "07f010beb9f79b943ff3575f03177d9105b993634d9497b9938e96c3ed65216e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "北方与南方有一个显著的区别，在我看来，就是北方缺水而南方水域丰富。",
      "output_sha256": "cda4eeaad0bbb6c8582e4a80142d76304144966ebb477df553f449b862e73e9f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.548094,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3703c0cef3c7ebea5e581220a7c49c67f44f1202a4b37f2b077ce67416297813"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cda4eeaad0bbb6c8582e4a80142d76304144966ebb477df553f449b862e73e9f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "诚然，北方今年大雨，永定河，大清河甚至决了堤防，但这并不能算是有水；北平的三海和颐和园虽然有点儿水，但太平衍了，一览而尽，船又那么笨头笨脑的。",
      "output_sha256": "4a56eeef5978aa2decc88c755194ef17ffc8f0a5eb13b2dee6856b0508748953",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a56eeef5978aa2decc88c755194ef17ffc8f0a5eb13b2dee6856b0508748953",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有水的仍然是南方。",
      "output_sha256": "376b85a46719b973b856690cbcbf256912e91adfadff77322c3d7db22e68eed1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "376b85a46719b973b856690cbcbf256912e91adfadff77322c3d7db22e68eed1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "扬州的夏天，迷人之处大多在于水，所谓“瘦西湖”其实名字太过于“瘦”，以假西湖之名自居，显得颇为俗气，老实说，我并不喜欢。",
      "output_sha256": "d5956d8a98ae1e3a97a437111845680e3619da322d8002275522c07d21af8462",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.540886,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9ea3fa39a7b4ac9f5dcc1743a9229c259abae7671ef02b5d6497292bad0fb4cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d5956d8a98ae1e3a97a437111845680e3619da322d8002275522c07d21af8462",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "下船的地方是护城河，蜿蜒而去，曲折延伸，直到平山堂。",
      "output_sha256": "426ffbf5cd989d81521a326fa374369e7188e7aec1fd9b2c8477657d411dfd78",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.599397,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b344ffffcb95735d1e9b230a46d15b80454c00a557683bd3471fe01e4adf3187"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "426ffbf5cd989d81521a326fa374369e7188e7aec1fd9b2c8477657d411dfd78",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这里有你们耳熟能详的河道，七八里长，还有许多支流分叉。",
      "output_sha256": "bb924391c2475ee28822baed87f0951bb9dc1e44afe74596d465e4d4df39644c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.599397,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b344ffffcb95735d1e9b230a46d15b80454c00a557683bd3471fe01e4adf3187"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bb924391c2475ee28822baed87f0951bb9dc1e44afe74596d465e4d4df39644c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这条河其实也没有顶大的好处，只是曲折而有些幽静，和别处不同。",
      "output_sha256": "b85373c8b6218a651c40d5acd0b61b876d6d6e4fd0f7496a36f7378a564e78fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "b85373c8b6218a651c40d5acd0b61b876d6d6e4fd0f7496a36f7378a564e78fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "沿河最著名的风景是小金山，法海寺，五亭桥；最远的便是平山堂了。",
      "output_sha256": "1a9c9d6475d4a38f729119ca0161f9be73912cb16db5eec84aebd50aa7511ab7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "1a9c9d6475d4a38f729119ca0161f9be73912cb16db5eec84aebd50aa7511ab7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "金山你们是知道的，小金山却在水中央。",
      "output_sha256": "bb63893951ccf9e2eb5f7bdaefe08cbdc06da0fe797cb54254c2e368a02de7b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb63893951ccf9e2eb5f7bdaefe08cbdc06da0fe797cb54254c2e368a02de7b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在那里望水最好，看月自然也不错可是我还不曾有过那样福气。",
      "output_sha256": "38f15c30b207ae57812ce5ee0f57f20a3714475744e80d50d7e95602a7d2d504",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "38f15c30b207ae57812ce5ee0f57f20a3714475744e80d50d7e95602a7d2d504",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "十个“下河”的人中有九个会选择这里，因而人流难免显得拥挤。",
      "output_sha256": "8e22d3d0e019bff7cd9adcacb8aa29c89dad58c04f3b5b68e1ad0b05a7ee0e17",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.360766,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6d834b587cdfcf080a71f8430d3a664735774508ee173c052ded194c85ced0df"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8e22d3d0e019bff7cd9adcacb8aa29c89dad58c04f3b5b68e1ad0b05a7ee0e17",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "法海寺有一个塔，和北海的一样，据说是乾隆皇帝下江南，盐商们连夜督促匠人造成的。",
      "output_sha256": "5a0cca69633dfa2c862102756817bc51e2278299e2e8b97e341f417a24cf459c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a0cca69633dfa2c862102756817bc51e2278299e2e8b97e341f417a24cf459c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "法海寺著名的自然是这个塔；但还有一桩，你们猜不着，是红烧猪头。",
      "output_sha256": "efe21a6dd97d22ed1f963e6095bc2e6e40fa770b45813a38b96e978a2a3a8eab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "efe21a6dd97d22ed1f963e6095bc2e6e40fa770b45813a38b96e978a2a3a8eab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "夏天吃红烧猪头，在理论上也许不甚相宜；可是在实际上，挥汗吃着，倒也不坏的。",
      "output_sha256": "53af8d92e14e114f4d36e6abfdbff122be4e4d848039650ec9479a88d27f2e5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "53af8d92e14e114f4d36e6abfdbff122be4e4d848039650ec9479a88d27f2e5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "五亭桥如名字所示，是五个亭子的桥。",
      "output_sha256": "3e99d74fdce53487d58b19d950d2bacb17ddcd90987cc690ded4252e6455a227",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e99d74fdce53487d58b19d950d2bacb17ddcd90987cc690ded4252e6455a227",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "桥是拱形，中一亭最高，两边四亭，参差相称；最宜远看，或看影子，也好。",
      "output_sha256": "d8ce4ab4022ec83d33fb63f27382c4ee5b836904fe87336d3449afeffedd4ca6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "d8ce4ab4022ec83d33fb63f27382c4ee5b836904fe87336d3449afeffedd4ca6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "桥洞颇多，乘小船穿来穿去，另有风味。",
      "output_sha256": "f82009ce6378faf410c68d1ace1b926144a240e5202697924a74ad27623d9a3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "f82009ce6378faf410c68d1ace1b926144a240e5202697924a74ad27623d9a3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "平山堂坐落在蜀冈之上，登堂可见江南诸山的淡淡轮廓；“山色有无中”这句话，我觉得恰如其分，并没有错。",
      "output_sha256": "c4b729fe6e17771e3af7cfa9c6944dae4e7988cc9752491ac164a2f49b4b2447",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.652668,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "97ba3a7e673e03d9947fa731af8e676818bb6a271ca53ebaa1e456cde7ea38b9",
        "1eb8f29b7864814361545c8711ce579b03d16641a8c0b1721d3a3ddcdb640880"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c4b729fe6e17771e3af7cfa9c6944dae4e7988cc9752491ac164a2f49b4b2447",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这里游人相对较少，坐在堂上可以悠闲度过整日。",
      "output_sha256": "28a23a270e31e6bb63f8aee267327772e2e05aeb3c7bbdddbb6b16cd507c1a85",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.621786,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ce8caa0405fbad6f6522f90cdf2c3d262f4c27ee714bfb69c8e529db4d8b61d3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "28a23a270e31e6bb63f8aee267327772e2e05aeb3c7bbdddbb6b16cd507c1a85",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "沿途的风景也以闲适为胜。",
      "output_sha256": "8c0074dfb15361c13837d5da87f8ad8f42adab63d584d1674be93e97256ddfd5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.518636,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "05b9dee014262764ed80fa378fddf9e001fd8d48b94f9ac02e7a5e38c61779c9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8c0074dfb15361c13837d5da87f8ad8f42adab63d584d1674be93e97256ddfd5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从天宁门或北门下船，蜿蜒的城墙在水中映出苍黝的影子，小船悠然划过，岸上的喧嚣似乎消失无踪。",
      "output_sha256": "d1cce76809ae756ce3c8907a50507f9982ef2b75d308abcda6b758ea23fe21e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.697841,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e527fc5e22f009fb6936c40efed47934599955e0d3a7f8d489e369efc51fec3d",
        "3dbfa21311d63695aa9918c0920ef530158fd4545de323f94cd017eee0704e87"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d1cce76809ae756ce3c8907a50507f9982ef2b75d308abcda6b758ea23fe21e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "船只有三种：大船专供宴游之用，可以带妓或打牌。",
      "output_sha256": "6d8f851ebe21124a439d371d9ae7b9d19e3cfe738678bb2a30a815dcda2c572a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.83493,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1a5675c26960708eae451c597d37582dcf9d2d8bc21c6c51c9460c7f71e8d1b6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6d8f851ebe21124a439d371d9ae7b9d19e3cfe738678bb2a30a815dcda2c572a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我小时候常随父亲去，船上听着谋得利洋行的唱片。",
      "output_sha256": "a413af2c4081cd77c1c66c2bbf30f42256c91b6b42bfb216427d92fa312afb9f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.748209,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "06639107fa0ca1397156c6dc385f436b1d989cb20ac280e0b878b9b97ffb50cc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a413af2c4081cd77c1c66c2bbf30f42256c91b6b42bfb216427d92fa312afb9f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "现在这样乘船的大概少了吧？",
      "output_sha256": "fcfd580ea73ac6f1000e97ad02ae161f422f33fc53bb5e54a604e652a36e6262",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "fcfd580ea73ac6f1000e97ad02ae161f422f33fc53bb5e54a604e652a36e6262",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其次是“小划子”，真像一瓣西瓜，由一个男人或女人用竹篙撑着。",
      "output_sha256": "1309d96b9e9097264f57a6c56392be993f025b8dd3cffa70c609bc442b68aff5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "1309d96b9e9097264f57a6c56392be993f025b8dd3cffa70c609bc442b68aff5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "乘的人多了，便可雇两只，前后用小凳子跨着：这也可算得“方舟”了。",
      "output_sha256": "b2f7e9bbf64de4ca6802427d2c55ae3e4201481819d8d28ec4589013745b836f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "b2f7e9bbf64de4ca6802427d2c55ae3e4201481819d8d28ec4589013745b836f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "后来又有一种“洋划”，比大船小，比“小划子”大，上支布篷，可以遮日遮雨。",
      "output_sha256": "43409582ddc86cc01c85d092749d657b0c9e6e8d921a6a182176bb70d6dfeee3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "43409582ddc86cc01c85d092749d657b0c9e6e8d921a6a182176bb70d6dfeee3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“洋划”渐渐地多，大船渐渐地少，然而“小划子”总是有人要的。",
      "output_sha256": "9d3b8f58f92bce310234edaef4d52e965909c6de0710e5b61505ae837cbc61e8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "9d3b8f58f92bce310234edaef4d52e965909c6de0710e5b61505ae837cbc61e8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这不独因为价钱最贱，也因为它的伶俐。",
      "output_sha256": "33902cab64db4dd9925ddadbedf642914b9465a27c133784e451163a8d935487",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "33902cab64db4dd9925ddadbedf642914b9465a27c133784e451163a8d935487",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "一个人坐在船中，让一个人站在船尾上用竹篙一下一下地撑着，简直是一首唐诗，或一幅山水画。",
      "output_sha256": "bb698387c1c4070071560c9c8f76271596356664b1a0e64bd4b228ef0edd0d0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "bb698387c1c4070071560c9c8f76271596356664b1a0e64bd4b228ef0edd0d0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而有些好事的少年，愿意自己撑船，也非“小划子”不行。",
      "output_sha256": "c4546ee612b9097f78291bd6bfb0ce96218f7c3dbbc24bef21ffb2fb1c023c27",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4546ee612b9097f78291bd6bfb0ce96218f7c3dbbc24bef21ffb2fb1c023c27",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“小划子”虽然便宜，却也有些讲究。",
      "output_sha256": "f468a446414fb56f6967fcb2bb2405419a3104f178fecae47496d26f1e44decd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.820055,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d7f19e43988de31b5bf58e6f0e565a8e64d56db3022e40166c1ac52143f0f20a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f468a446414fb56f6967fcb2bb2405419a3104f178fecae47496d26f1e44decd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "譬如说，你们也可想到的，女人撑船总要贵些；姑娘撑的自然更要贵。",
      "output_sha256": "0e213204c0cb7abd32031bc3624972bccc20e03f0fb7f353235a9389e92a1b3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "0e213204c0cb7abd32031bc3624972bccc20e03f0fb7f353235a9389e92a1b3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这些撑船的女子，便是有人说过的“瘦西湖上的船娘”。",
      "output_sha256": "87cbff04ee1778ffe9bdc0fca0bc25e37715fc4f1240a12a7aeb3b3770b6df53",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "87cbff04ee1778ffe9bdc0fca0bc25e37715fc4f1240a12a7aeb3b3770b6df53",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "船娘们的故事大概不少，但我不很知道。",
      "output_sha256": "42b1427ca613f31fbb6dca8ecf8f79cc171fe3c313934a3fb756ea45cc344b1c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "42b1427ca613f31fbb6dca8ecf8f79cc171fe3c313934a3fb756ea45cc344b1c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "据说以乱头粗服，风趣天然为胜；中年而有风趣，也仍然算好。",
      "output_sha256": "d6a02e7ad9e94efd098012a24b6967ec01c82bc7c62d1e30f4b46e169c138770",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "d6a02e7ad9e94efd098012a24b6967ec01c82bc7c62d1e30f4b46e169c138770",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而最初只是逢场作戏，或许不伤风雅；后来竟然有了价格，便觉得味道索然。",
      "output_sha256": "ecb56bc3f3959a12d554c9d53f29bb6d911c22bcae836fdcd9c5d828598b29ae",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.598301,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9eb0a38542f133b4779cd1852e5b0580c862c7b1484bf6001ee87c068c70d8a6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ecb56bc3f3959a12d554c9d53f29bb6d911c22bcae836fdcd9c5d828598b29ae",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "北门外一带，称之为下街，茶馆最多，往往临河而建。",
      "output_sha256": "92d3939d85070bcce3fb4bdc5c09b16cd8dbddd56ffa60a64dbff71874ed6311",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": 0.705154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1f14a76ebcda614b03cdc14b564b0b04d2c9d00e6fc2f07775f62410a745774b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "92d3939d85070bcce3fb4bdc5c09b16cd8dbddd56ffa60a64dbff71874ed6311",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "船行过时，茶客与乘客可以随便招呼说话。",
      "output_sha256": "ceb7297816a01b6b4695699568bf185539cb8b6994d165b8badb6df7e783bee8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "ceb7297816a01b6b4695699568bf185539cb8b6994d165b8badb6df7e783bee8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "船上人若高兴时，也可以向茶馆中要一壶茶，或一两种“小笼点心”，在河中喝着，吃着，谈着。",
      "output_sha256": "e2a17521d37260871b1c1bb4c6f9d80fce12c3a20ae3fc2a2c243c88ba281e11",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "e2a17521d37260871b1c1bb4c6f9d80fce12c3a20ae3fc2a2c243c88ba281e11",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "回来时再将茶壶和所谓小笼，连价款一并交给茶馆中人。",
      "output_sha256": "2c20052ed5f9bd0d386294a37f0198b3da410e18eb5f9384f0eb163afce77188",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c20052ed5f9bd0d386294a37f0198b3da410e18eb5f9384f0eb163afce77188",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "撑船的都与茶馆相熟，他们不怕你白吃。",
      "output_sha256": "df62cd15c7a4870ca3285738cf36287f36852833d2a3ed736d8bfbe930332a94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "df62cd15c7a4870ca3285738cf36287f36852833d2a3ed736d8bfbe930332a94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "扬州的小笼点心确实很好：我离开扬州后，走过七八个地方，还没吃过如此美味的点心；这实在值得怀念。",
      "output_sha256": "f3af272aa92832ae46758351a0a8dbd9e399ad08c3a097c8828050300f76f728",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": 0.58544,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "792b80d6b329693e4fc0bb2f14ea2ff9104c37bfb464509941449269da8f12fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f3af272aa92832ae46758351a0a8dbd9e399ad08c3a097c8828050300f76f728",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "茶馆的环境大致都不错，名字也颇有趣味。",
      "output_sha256": "994058094496c183220fdaf63e8ca998b1e7d24b3d5b7eb4d7f24f065bc7d1a1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.573463,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cfb0a41eec238800c47501f9faaaa5f052fd928a571acf86a4304ea043762ebb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "994058094496c183220fdaf63e8ca998b1e7d24b3d5b7eb4d7f24f065bc7d1a1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如香影廊、绿杨村、红叶山庄，至今仍让我记忆犹新。",
      "output_sha256": "8635e82fbf4ef7b21dc7339b9b29b1fc16f652732efe06879223082d0b280f43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.602143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "01974b38a92ee03042cf6294fd0fdbe65a1238dcc4f47fa1b46758a1239a7ca4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8635e82fbf4ef7b21dc7339b9b29b1fc16f652732efe06879223082d0b280f43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "绿杨村的幌子，挂在绿杨树上，随风飘展，使人想起“绿杨城郭是扬州”的名句。",
      "output_sha256": "c3534c777ad64adfff08addfc6849fde4cc9af0d78877c7561557bd7c0448829",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "c3534c777ad64adfff08addfc6849fde4cc9af0d78877c7561557bd7c0448829",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "里面还有小池，丛竹，茅亭，景物最幽。",
      "output_sha256": "e943062cd17efb5fe59be8bb49e4fa6e3ce9eb33529904ffda4085f64d79eec8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "e943062cd17efb5fe59be8bb49e4fa6e3ce9eb33529904ffda4085f64d79eec8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这一带的茶馆布置都别具一格，完全不同于上海、北方方方正正的茶楼。",
      "output_sha256": "090b360e77485dbd31f7907eb07fd2e16d994fb858d16de2a26c0f53bc7a9e3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.639725,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c450cd0706575476d69d1c90768985e177c614f2834063fb06a1442e0cb3a4bb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "090b360e77485dbd31f7907eb07fd2e16d994fb858d16de2a26c0f53bc7a9e3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“下河”总是下午。",
      "output_sha256": "e645dcfcf7e9d32979a3b309ba3513e0866ec47afe5c222ce1202446aacc97de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "e645dcfcf7e9d32979a3b309ba3513e0866ec47afe5c222ce1202446aacc97de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "傍晚回来，在暮霭朦胧中上了岸，将大褂折好搭在腕上，一手微微摇着扇子；这样进了北门或天宁门走回家中。",
      "output_sha256": "21cdaee392ac0c5e76ea28a113acdd32d7eeb6ba063e0420d1b601c620ce6e14",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "21cdaee392ac0c5e76ea28a113acdd32d7eeb6ba063e0420d1b601c620ce6e14",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这时候可以念“又得浮生半日闲”那一句诗了。",
      "output_sha256": "0d04fb6071bd30e055cf45e32410c46ec499d2802a545c36df301e3bb4f6608b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d04fb6071bd30e055cf45e32410c46ec499d2802a545c36df301e3bb4f6608b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
